  "durationMs": 239571,
  "measuredScopes": [
    "Real 8000 kr start; no state grants",
    "Complete 2026–2036 campaigns through public G.act",
    "Existing trade/delegation heuristic with varied quest, crime and arc decisions",
    "Persistence validation after every injected action",
    "Default delegated civic choices, one-time market shocks and real standing ownership mandates",
    "Seed replay covered separately by integration tests"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Heuristic policies are not human playtests or an approval of fun or balance",
    "Quest completion depends on profile: high heat can leave later social quests unfinished",
    "No browser rendering, accessibility, save-file IO or audio is exercised here",
    "Godfather reach is reported independently of arc activation: late arc access alone does not prove rank progression.",
    "economy actions count only business-policy calls; playerActionsAfterGodfather also includes injected story/mandate actions. The separate denominators are retained, not substituted."
  ],
